{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.92},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.04,"end":35.6},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.12,"end":50.4}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":1.76,"text":"頻率主要決定音高，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.16,"end":4.16,"text":"振幅改變訊號強度。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.88,"end":7.6,"text":"音樂頻率加倍會提高一個八度。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.16,"end":12,"text":"聽感音量也受頻率與聆聽條件影響，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.373,"end":15.92,"text":"因此振幅不是通用的響度刻度。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.04,"end":22.16,"text":"以相同低振幅比較 220 和 440 Hz，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.56,"end":26.4,"text":"再固定 440 Hz 輕微調整振幅，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.88,"end":29.52,"text":"分辨哪個改變影響音高。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":31.44,"end":35.6,"text":"哪個調整能把 220 Hz 提高一個八度？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.12,"end":41.44,"text":"哪個調整能把 220 Hz 提高一個八度？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.72,"end":46.96,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":47.6,"end":50.4,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}